      "text": "#lang racket/base\n;; Shapes with classes, structs and contracts.\n\n(require racket/class\n         racket/contract\n         racket/match\n         (only-in racket/list first rest empty?)\n         (prefix-in str: racket/string)\n         (for-syntax racket/base syntax/parse)\n         \"private/util.rkt\")\n\n(provide (contract-out [area (-\u003e shape? real?)])\n         shape%\n         (struct-out point))",
      "hash": "b62eddb396894f6e35b2a7673d83863c9054eb9fb5510c55db42f8a997ba9d60"
    },
    {
      "id": "point#1",
      "kind": "symbol",
      "symbolId": "point",
      "start": {
